{"t": 1794099737.04, "event": "run_start", "task": "Hill Climb relay. Stage 1: unplug one USB cable that starts in the hub and put it down away from the hub; then plug loose USB cables (ones that started lying on the table) into free hub ports. Never plug an unplugged cable back in. Stage 2: stack blocks into a free-standing tower more than 4 inches (10 cm) tall. Do not touch the blocks before a cable is unplugged. Stage 3: put golf balls into the bin, never either black 8-ball, without touching the tower. Do not touch the golf balls before the tower passes.", "dry_run": false, "stages": ["unplug_cable", "put_cable_down", "unplug_more", "put_more_down", "plug_1", "arms_clear", "stack_2", "stack_3", "tower_pass", "higher_1", "higher_2", "plug_2", "ball_1", "ball_2", "ball_3", "ball_4", "ball_5", "ball_6", "ball_7", "ball_8"]}
